  "description": "Cheonga’s first love turned out to be something of a player, and she simply refuses to fall for that type again. Yet somehow, she finds herself in a fake relationship with Seokjae Ban, who is exactly the kind of man she was determined to avoid. He is smooth and careless, and his reputation as a womanizer precedes him. And yet, he seems to be mostly disinterested in others, but is unable to keep his distance from Cheonga. Is he just messing with her, or could this be the start of something more serious?\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
